  "description": "Christmas Wonderland – A Fun & Whimsical Digital Pattern Collection\nBring festive cheer to your Holiday projects with the Christmas Wonderland pattern collection! This set of 8 seamless digital patterns captures the cozy charm of whimsical Christmas villages, with snowy scenes, fun snow globes, cottages and shops, as well as festive plaid, colourful stripes and snowflakes\nWith a festive and bright color palette of pink, red, teal and green, these patterns are perfect for Christmas party printables, scrapbooking, planner stickers, fabric design, kids’ crafts, and more. The mix of whimsical scenes and fun blender designs makes it easy to create enchanting, cohesive projects.\nAll files are seamless, allowing you to tile them effortlessly to create larger prints without losing quality.\nThis product comes in 1 Zipped folder (30 MB) and includes:\n• 8 High Quality SEAMLESS Digital Patterns\n• High Resolution (300 dpi) for crisp, professional-quality prints\n• Each file is 12 x 12 inches (305 x 305 mm | 3600 x 3600 pixels)\nFile Formats:\n• 8 PNG files in RGB – Ideal for digital use\n• 8 JPEG files in CMYK – Perfect for printing\nPLEASE NOTE:\n• For best results, use the JPEG files for printing and PNG files for digital use\n• If you’re sending your files to a print shop, confirm their preferred file format\n• Colours may vary slightly due to different screen and printer settings",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Christmas Wonderland – A Fun &amp; Whimsical Digital Pattern Collection</p>\n<p>Bring festive cheer to your Holiday projects with the Christmas Wonderland pattern collection! This set of 8 seamless digital patterns captures the cozy charm of whimsical Christmas villages, with snowy scenes, fun snow globes, cottages and shops, as well as festive plaid, colourful stripes and snowflakes</p>\n<p>With a festive and bright color palette of pink, red, teal and green, these patterns are perfect for Christmas party printables, scrapbooking, planner stickers, fabric design, kids’ crafts, and more. The mix of whimsical scenes and fun blender designs makes it easy to create enchanting, cohesive projects.</p>\n<p>All files are seamless, allowing you to tile them effortlessly to create larger prints without losing quality.</p>\n<p>This product comes in 1 Zipped folder (30 MB) and includes:<br>\n• 8 High Quality SEAMLESS Digital Patterns<br>\n• High Resolution (300 dpi) for crisp, professional-quality prints<br>\n• Each file is 12 x 12 inches (305 x 305 mm | 3600 x 3600 pixels)</p>\n<p>File Formats:<br>\n• 8 PNG files in RGB – Ideal for digital use<br>\n• 8 JPEG files in CMYK – Perfect for printing</p>\n<p>PLEASE NOTE:<br>\n• For best results, use the JPEG files for printing and PNG files for digital use<br>\n• If you’re sending your files to a print shop, confirm their preferred file format<br>\n• Colours may vary slightly due to different screen and printer settings</p>",
